            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"ko\">\r\n  <head>\r\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"방과후학교 수강신청, 늘봄학교 수강신청, 자유학기제 수강신청, 우유신청, 온라인 연수지명부 작성 등 학교 교직원 업무 경감을 위한 온라인 서비스를 제공합니다.\" />\r\n\t<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"방과후학교,늘봄학교,우유신청,연수지명부,수강신청,늘봄학교 수강신청,자유학기제 수강신청,방과후 신청,방과후 수강신청,방과후학교 신청,방과후학교 수강신청,방과후학교 프로그램,방과후학교 운영시스템,방과후학교 온라인시스템\" />\r\n\t<meta name=\"author\" content=\"엑스메카\" />\t\r\n\t<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\" />\r\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0, width=device-width\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\"  href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/images/mobile_ico_2.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon-precomposed\" sizes=\"114x114\" href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/images/mobile_ico_2.png\" />\r\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/images/mobile_ico_2.png\" />\r\n\t\r\n\t<title>추가/취소자조회 - 신청자관리 - 늘봄학교</title>\r\n\t<link href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/css/bootstrap.css?23111301\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\r\n\t<link href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/css/bootstrap-theme.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\r\n\t<link href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/js/ui/jquery-ui.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\r\n\t<link href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/css/default.css?26061201\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\r\n\t<link href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/css/af/content.css?26033101\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" />\r\n\t<link href=\"https://s3-ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/www.dbdbschool.kr/icon/css/font-awesome.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"t